  "description": "Diagnosed with stage 4 lung cancer, Soyi is given only one year to live. Having known nothing but work, she creates a bucket list. \n\n\"I'm tall, handsome, and well-mannered. I'll help you with your bucket list.\" \n\nCaught off-guard by the proposal of a contractual relationship from Dojun, her handsome boss, Soyi finds herself getting physically involved with him!\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/2655000658)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515031790), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000061592), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10836352), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64922461), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240230), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/7816), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/9622)  \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515031800), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000061594), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10836354), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/tlgksqndusdo), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/time_limited_love_contract_15), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240231), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63760009), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/9624), [Blice](https://www.blice.co.kr/mw/detail.kt?novelId=93467) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/limited-time-love-contract/list?title_no=6344), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000796), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4084)     \nR15: [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000797)",
